[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7620.709, "timestamp": "02:07:00", "text": "我喜欢和陌生人聊天"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7622.229, "timestamp": "02:07:02", "text": "不同类型的人和会议"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7624.55, "timestamp": "02:07:04", "text": "就像形形色色的人一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7626.87, "timestamp": "02:07:06", "text": "是的，我也通过这个意识到了这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7629.589, "timestamp": "02:07:09", "text": "跑步马拉松之类​​的活动。我确实喜欢这种类型。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7631.669, "timestamp": "02:07:11", "text": "我可以在那种环境下坐下来聊天。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7634.95, "timestamp": "02:07:14", "text": "关于一些事情，我过去常常觉得自己"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7637.91, "timestamp": "02:07:17", "text": "我不擅长说话，甚至连这都做不到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7639.99, "timestamp": "02:07:19", "text": "聊天直播之类的，现在看看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7643.589, "timestamp": "02:07:23", "text": "我试图张开嘴说话，却被他们吓了一跳。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7647.75, "timestamp": "02:07:27", "text": "还有更多话题要想。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7649.75, "timestamp": "02:07:29", "text": "我当时就想，是啊，事情太多了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7651.83, "timestamp": "02:07:31", "text": "这些都是造成这种情况的原因。你必须"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7654.629, "timestamp": "02:07:34", "text": "把这些主题写在纸上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7657.35, "timestamp": "02:07:37", "text": "还有那个，还有这个，还有那个。现在我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7660.229, "timestamp": "02:07:40", "text": "我也不知道自己是怎么应付过来的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7663.51, "timestamp": "02:07:43", "text": "是的。我觉得它只需要一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7665.189, "timestamp": "02:07:45", "text": "最初几次布局"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7667.27, "timestamp": "02:07:47", "text": "这样做，过一段时间就自然而然地发生了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7669.55, "timestamp": "02:07:49", "text": "自然排出。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7673.069, "timestamp": "02:07:53", "text": "是的，这是自然而然发生的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7678.069, "timestamp": "02:07:58", "text": "是的。真好。就像我曾经那样"}]